{"diagram":{"image":{"x":0,"width":200,"y":0,"pngdata":"","height":200},"elements":{"leftChildren":[],"comments":[],"children":[{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"09f5355a22d084dd","children":[{"parent":"4c777070584e1a59","children":[{"parent":"88f693c5c457b573","children":[{"parent":"1814a796d9d113ab","children":[],"id":"146b6cdabf4fc6b3","title":"编译错误一般是因为语法问题，所以检查一下语法。<br>C***"},{"parent":"1814a796d9d113ab","children":[],"id":"0569fa79fa2304c3","title":"链接错误，一般是找不到函数的函数体。&nbsp;<br>"}],"collapsed":false,"id":"1814a796d9d113ab","title":"要先处理掉编译错误、链接错误。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"88f693c5c457b573","title":"前提：代码要能跑起来"},{"parent":"4c777070584e1a59","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"dff88142c9ba9a09","title":"程序员自己心里要有预期。&nbsp;调试其实就是一个信息比对的任务。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"16px"},"id":"4c777070584e1a59","title":"调试代码的含义"},{"parent":"09f5355a22d084dd","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"9eda1437c27f0e89","title":"打断点"},{"parent":"09f5355a22d084dd","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"42148e115702b270","title":"跳到下一个断点"},{"parent":"09f5355a22d084dd","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"c42648e717fd41c8","title":"逐过程（波浪线箭头）：&nbsp;碰到自己写的函数会进去"},{"parent":"09f5355a22d084dd","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"906bdb3081e5c365","title":"逐语句(向下箭头)：&nbsp;碰到函数会跳过。直接执行结束"},{"parent":"09f5355a22d084dd","children":[{"parent":"c02f65ebe3e1bfb5","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"15d6f3a2a435613e","title":"技巧1：&nbsp;如何知道打断点的位置。<br>眼睛扫一下，哪里容易出错，就往哪里打断点"},{"parent":"c02f65ebe3e1bfb5","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"f58b53897cec5db5","title":"技巧2：程序崩溃了，怎么知道在哪出了问题<br>可以注释一下，如果注释了之后，就不出问题了。可能问题就在这里"},{"parent":"c02f65ebe3e1bfb5","children":[],"id":"653448aae83b9547","title":"技巧3：&nbsp;建议大家根据数据的流向来分析问题。&nbsp;这个数据从哪来，被谁改过。&nbsp;<br>"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"c02f65ebe3e1bfb5","title":"调试需要多练习"},{"parent":"09f5355a22d084dd","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"199b911dfc5faa18","title":"如果调试--窗口看不到内存。&nbsp;这时候先将程序运行起来。然后才能看到"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"09f5355a22d084dd","title":"vs调试"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"4aa0033b05396d7a","children":[{"parent":"8934238fba395cde","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"9b930d94b3c3fa46","title":"标准输出。&nbsp;输出到屏幕。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"8934238fba395cde","children":[],"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"16px"},"id":"7920af18225aaeb7","title":"printf是有一个缓冲区的，也就是输出的内容，<br>会先进入缓冲区（内存上），&nbsp;等到合适的时机，再往外刷"},{"parent":"8934238fba395cde","children":[{"parent":"955c7e41060592ac","children":[{"parent":"53cebf47b7a1fc6e","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"cd227682ef3cce77","title":"当缓冲区满的时候，数据才会刷新到目的地。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"53cebf47b7a1fc6e","title":"满缓冲区"},{"parent":"955c7e41060592ac","children":[{"parent":"bca07a7b094a42a8","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"e60afa9b3f001abf","title":"printf就是行缓冲区。<br>如果在不影响业务逻辑下，建议printf加 \\n"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"bca07a7b094a42a8","title":"行缓冲区"},{"parent":"955c7e41060592ac","children":[{"parent":"a5333b3d17d4a17f","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"f8c34ae981d86c57","title":"stderr就是无缓冲区"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"a5333b3d17d4a17f","title":"无缓冲区"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"955c7e41060592ac","title":"缓冲区的几个分类"},{"parent":"8934238fba395cde","children":[{"parent":"f431b8f1d536893d","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"7d618765619ee9c7","title":"平衡速度的差异。&nbsp;一方速度快，一方速度慢，可以加缓冲区平衡两者的速度差异。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"f431b8f1d536893d","title":"面试题：缓冲区的作用？"},{"parent":"8934238fba395cde","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"78528d2b8e82312f","title":"上课讲的比较多的是重点。&nbsp;另外有一些比较简单的，大家能自己看懂，就没有使劲讲"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"8934238fba395cde","title":"printf"},{"parent":"4aa0033b05396d7a","children":[{"parent":"3fa19b31a7a677f1","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"c3b9a135d5f5555c","title":"scanf就是从键盘做输入"},{"parent":"3fa19b31a7a677f1","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"823b71b108a169de","title":"scanf也有缓冲区，也就是我们输入的数据，会先进入一个叫做 stdin的输入缓冲区中。&nbsp;然后CPU是从这块读数据的"},{"parent":"3fa19b31a7a677f1","children":[{"parent":"183def7255b6baf5","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"81d50431fec4e938","title":"// scanf函数会从左到右依次匹配格式字符串中的每一项：<br>// 如果匹配数据项成功，那么scanf函数会继续处理格式串的剩余部分；<br>// 如果匹配不成功，那么scanf函数将不再处理格式串的剩余部分，而会立刻返回。"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"183def7255b6baf5","title":"工作原理比较重要"},{"parent":"3fa19b31a7a677f1","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"24aecb73f6181045","title":"录入字符这块比较特殊<br>要注意&nbsp;空格和换行符的影响<br>解决方式，建议在%c 前面加上一个空格。 可以匹配n个空格。 也可以匹配换行符这种"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"3fa19b31a7a677f1","title":"scanf"},{"parent":"4aa0033b05396d7a","children":[{"parent":"1935523e8610cd4f","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"0154120ea1ec8a8a","title":"族函数"},{"parent":"1935523e8610cd4f","children":[{"parent":"310b7e1a9ed659c2","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"d82a8651fa27a86b","title":"fprintf(fp, \"%d %d\", num, num2);"},{"parent":"310b7e1a9ed659c2","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"4367198000441920","title":"sprintf(arr, \"%d %d\", num1, num2);"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"310b7e1a9ed659c2","title":"printf是往屏幕做输出的。&nbsp;<br>fprintf&nbsp;也是做输出的。&nbsp;输出目的地是文件。&nbsp;<br>sprintf&nbsp;也是做输出。&nbsp;输出的目的地是字符串"},{"parent":"1935523e8610cd4f","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"42a088e429256317","title":"scanf&nbsp;做输入的。&nbsp;从键盘做输入<br>fscanf&nbsp;做输入的。&nbsp;从文件中做输入<br>sscanf&nbsp;做输入的。&nbsp;从字符串中做输入"},{"parent":"1935523e8610cd4f","children":[],"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"16px"},"id":"3123590ae3b5ed91","title":"一定要清楚的知道printf是做输出的。&nbsp; fprintf/sprintf&nbsp;都是输出"},{"parent":"1935523e8610cd4f","children":[],"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"16px"},"id":"54da287a1ed1cb86","title":"scanf是做输入的，sscanf fscanf&nbsp;都是输入，只是数据的来源不同"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"16px"},"id":"1935523e8610cd4f","title":"fprintf / fscanf<br>sprintf / sscanf"},{"parent":"4aa0033b05396d7a","children":[{"parent":"21e7c25370de2bad","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"4cce41e3e8404177","title":"printf(\"%d, %d\\n\", &amp;i, &amp;j); /*** WRONG ***/"},{"parent":"21e7c25370de2bad","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"02bc429948d4f562","title":"scanf(\"%d, %d\", &amp;a, &amp;b);&nbsp; &nbsp; // 这样写输入的数据必须是 \"10, 20\"格式的<br>scanf(\"%d\\n\", &amp;a);&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; // 错误的添加换行"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"21e7c25370de2bad","title":"使用的时候printf和scanf的使用，不要混淆了"},{"parent":"4aa0033b05396d7a","children":[{"parent":"f064067e98f669a0","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"be387b2548307b0f","title":"分子分母的输入，两个分数相加"},{"parent":"f064067e98f669a0","children":[{"parent":"65c72154b3ef9799","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"62dd7dff85840017","title":"1.搜索引擎搜。&nbsp;<br>技巧就是：&nbsp;想一下关键词，然后关键词空格&nbsp;全输入进去<br>不要用百度。 bing.com"},{"parent":"65c72154b3ef9799","children":[{"parent":"18d9d9f185308128","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"9b0e5ce55a2af01c","title":"现在，我需要在C语言中，从键盘录入两个分数。&nbsp;<br>紧接着将这两个分数求和。<br>求和之后，帮我化简一下。"},{"parent":"18d9d9f185308128","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"8435eb0ded084beb","title":"一定要学会和AI沟通"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"18d9d9f185308128","title":"2.可以问一下AI。<br>技巧就是：&nbsp;你需要清晰的说出你的需求。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"16px"},"id":"65c72154b3ef9799","title":"假设今天需要你化简，<br>你不知道化简的算法。&nbsp;怎么办？"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"f064067e98f669a0","title":"练习"}],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"4aa0033b05396d7a","title":"标准输入输出"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"297148c2b0206f54","children":[{"parent":"b7b5319035a59ce6","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"2557cd822bf05cbf","title":"可以用来计算一个类型、变量占多大空间。"},{"parent":"b7b5319035a59ce6","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"36907ef632c80cf7","title":"sizeof(int)<br>sizeof(num)<br>sizeof(1+2)"},{"parent":"b7b5319035a59ce6","children":[{"parent":"1467c616a76ab257","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"18ed97df2283d012","title":"这个是一个和系统位数相关的，无符号的整数<br>"},{"parent":"1467c616a76ab257","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"2aff770ab39382ff","title":"这个其实叫做类型别名，就是另外取的一个名字，小名"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"1467c616a76ab257","title":"返回值是一个size_t"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"b7b5319035a59ce6","title":"sizeof运算符<br>"},{"parent":"297148c2b0206f54","children":[{"parent":"b627a91090f755a5","children":[{"parent":"78962f8b1208bc45","children":[],"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"32e9e43a1d68e866","title":"有符号和无符号的区别得会"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"78962f8b1208bc45","title":"整体分两类：有符号、无符号"},{"parent":"b627a91090f755a5","children":[{"parent":"881b87359b68a6cd","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"32178144eaf047f3","title":"注意事项：不要直接认为int直接一定是4个字节。在有一些环境中，可能只有2个字节"},{"parent":"881b87359b68a6cd","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"cad4ed508740efbc","title":"C标准规定了最小的字节。还规定了大小顺序"},{"parent":"881b87359b68a6cd","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"16px"},"id":"b3e5a1d6e71c4bbe","title":"一般使用int居多"},{"parent":"881b87359b68a6cd","children":[{"parent":"6055788e7e06f183","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"4949d7c39f55c735","title":"不然这里可能出现一个误解，就是误认为这个是1."},{"parent":"6055788e7e06f183","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"337ec367a771af1d","title":"101<br>10l<br>10L"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"6055788e7e06f183","title":"注意1：在写一个字面值long类型的常量时，一定是L。"},{"parent":"881b87359b68a6cd","children":[{"parent":"ab32761e451b9693","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"0df913583c1013e4","title":"使用无符号数和有符号数比较的时候，可能会出现代码的实际和我们的预期不一致"},{"parent":"ab32761e451b9693","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"21c474a269c6be5e","title":"建议：一般使用有符号数。除非迫不得已，不然不要使用无符号数"},{"parent":"ab32761e451b9693","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"16px"},"id":"3c1a246e1921b7ff","title":"如果确实要使用无符号数，不要和有符号数混用"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"ab32761e451b9693","title":"注意2：无符号数的时候时需要注意"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"881b87359b68a6cd","title":"short int long long long"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"b627a91090f755a5","title":"整型"},{"parent":"297148c2b0206f54","children":[{"parent":"c5a7ac0e94599090","children":[],"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"16px"},"id":"b036a54ab31abb4d","title":"知道浮点数的不精确是绝对的就可以了"},{"parent":"c5a7ac0e94599090","children":[{"parent":"cb109983768382ba","children":[],"id":"f331e2607ae8fbb5","title":"float&nbsp;的范围要比 long long大的多。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"cb109983768382ba","title":"它是使用的科学计数法，所以存储的范围比较大"},{"parent":"c5a7ac0e94599090","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"45103e566facacd4","title":"float占4个字节；&nbsp;double占8个字节"},{"parent":"c5a7ac0e94599090","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"a5087518ac0c90c7","title":"扩展：如果不想有精度损失问题，这时候，可以使用字符串来存储这些数据。&nbsp;<br>字符串后面会具体讲"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"c5a7ac0e94599090","title":"浮点型"},{"parent":"297148c2b0206f54","children":[{"parent":"328f622afed27b9f","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"e224af189fa7b6b5","title":"字符型的底层，其实也是使用的整型来存数据"},{"parent":"328f622afed27b9f","children":[{"parent":"85f473b8f99a41b6","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"4ea3c9bdf3e623a3","title":"其实是使用的一个编码表，将所有的字符弄一个对应关系，现在需要存储这个字符，就等价于要存储这个数。<br>下次见到这个数，就转换过来"},{"parent":"85f473b8f99a41b6","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"1b87c49e8c0513a3","title":"比如， a对应的就是97。现在要存储a，就把97存上。<br>下次取出来是97，那这就是a。"},{"parent":"85f473b8f99a41b6","children":[{"parent":"aac04f244d065cfd","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"eba19f42ef0bb6e9","title":"ASCII：&nbsp;美国标准委员会指定的编码表，使用1个字节来编码。所以能存储的字符比较有限。只有英文<br>"},{"parent":"aac04f244d065cfd","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"31aa6d57f726e378","title":"GBK：&nbsp;中国自己定义的编码表，里面有中文的编码<br>"},{"parent":"aac04f244d065cfd","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"e3737b64857e4bd7","title":"UTF-8:&nbsp;是一个国际标准的编码表，兼容ASCII，里面有有中文、日文、韩文等多种语言"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"aac04f244d065cfd","title":"常见编码表"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"16px"},"id":"85f473b8f99a41b6","title":"计算机是怎么存储这些字符的"},{"parent":"328f622afed27b9f","children":[{"parent":"2f36b8cb0029d929","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"4b83ffc25013922a","title":"scanf(\"%c\", &amp;ch);<br>printf(\"%c\", ch);"},{"parent":"2f36b8cb0029d929","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"eea80baaaa05b056","title":"putchar&nbsp;<br>getchar"},{"parent":"2f36b8cb0029d929","children":[{"parent":"7259960a969d3ae7","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"4c76502baa44b6df","title":"int ch;<br>while((ch = getchar()) != '\\n'){<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; //&nbsp;里面单独处理一个字符<br>}"},{"parent":"7259960a969d3ae7","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"70cba4e104d85d64","title":"清空缓冲区的习惯写法<br>int ch;<br>while((ch = getchar()) != '\\n');<br>"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"16px"},"id":"7259960a969d3ae7","title":"如果想一行一行的读取，<br>这时候可以使用getchar&nbsp;完成。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"2f36b8cb0029d929","title":"读写字符"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"328f622afed27b9f","title":"字符型"},{"parent":"297148c2b0206f54","children":[{"parent":"f42ca05a0f3368e4","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"10ebd4315f14302d","title":"类型转换分为：隐式类型转换、强制类型转换"},{"parent":"f42ca05a0f3368e4","children":[{"parent":"2006adbe6167a858","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"223a77ae7dd6c069","title":"int a = 10.1;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;// 隐式类型转换，数据截断<br>char b = 97.9f;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;// 隐式类型转换，数据截断<br>double c = 0.1;<br>float d = c;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; // 隐式类型转换，数据精度丢失"},{"parent":"2006adbe6167a858","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"22cf6c619f795af6","title":"转换等级了解一下，基本就是根据这个类型能表示的范围，&nbsp;整数不用说，基本就是按照字节数<br>float虽然是4字节，但是是科学计数法，所以范围要比整数大<br>整数&nbsp; &lt;&nbsp; float &lt; double&nbsp;<br>哪个桶更大，更能装<br>"},{"parent":"2006adbe6167a858","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"fa74ac3e92701f7b","title":"整数提升：&nbsp;当表达式中仅有int以及int以下等级的类型参与时，表达式的结果一律是int(或者unsigned int)<br>"},{"parent":"2006adbe6167a858","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"44957362f1623855","title":"算术转换：&nbsp;简单说，表达式中有一个大的范围的值，这个表达式的结果就是大的范围<br>比如里面有long，&nbsp;最后计算的结果就是long<br>int&nbsp; + long&nbsp; ==&gt;&nbsp;结果是long&nbsp;<br>int + double&nbsp; &nbsp;===&gt; double<br>long long + float ===&gt;&nbsp; float"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"2006adbe6167a858","title":"隐式类型转换：&nbsp;这一过程是自动完成的，如果赋值表达式右边值的类型和左边变量的类型不匹配，<br>则赋值表达式右边值的类型会被隐式转换为左边变量的类型<br>"},{"parent":"f42ca05a0f3368e4","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"6b1b31fec184b8dc","title":"强制类型转换：在表达式前面加上一个转换类型的符号。&nbsp;<br>(type_name) expression<br>char ch = 18;"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"f42ca05a0f3368e4","title":"类型转换"},{"parent":"297148c2b0206f54","children":[{"parent":"987e40331179f7e6","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"9e2e7273255c5814","title":"我们可以使用typedef关键字用于为现有的数据类型创建新的名称，即类型别名。"},{"parent":"987e40331179f7e6","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"f4727d43f2f95b90","title":"语法<br>typedef 现有类型的名字 别名;<br>typedef int DataType;"},{"parent":"987e40331179f7e6","children":[{"parent":"081117909c77423e","children":[{"parent":"30ac9e94f51fc64a","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"1424de68b9aa7b6e","title":"比如链表中，是由一个一个的结点构成的。我们可以给结点取名Node。<br>可以提升代码可读性<br>栈帧。 StackFrame"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"30ac9e94f51fc64a","title":"提升代码的可读性<br>"},{"parent":"081117909c77423e","children":[{"parent":"6c4618516f26e823","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"217f847f936aeddf","title":"typedef&nbsp; int DataType;<br>"},{"parent":"6c4618516f26e823","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"9805c9f6e098281d","title":"后续可以在不同的环境下，只用改一行代码。&nbsp;<br>比如，在平常环境下，使用int就可以。&nbsp;<br>在一些int只有2字节的环境中，可以将int改成 long 。即 typedef long DataType"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"6c4618516f26e823","title":"提升代码的扩展性"},{"parent":"081117909c77423e","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"f5d8ad2cee52aff5","title":"提升代码的跨平台性移植性"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"081117909c77423e","title":"好处"},{"parent":"987e40331179f7e6","children":[{"parent":"77d0f921b17650c6","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"e39e9b787e211f10","title":"它会为类型别名取一个名字。&nbsp;一般是以_t结尾。<br>size_t:&nbsp;与环境和编译器相关的无符号整数。&nbsp;一般用它来存储长度，个数，大小<br>int8_t:<br>int16_t:<br>int32_t:&nbsp;有什么好处，就是在任何环境下都可以使用，而且长度是固定的<br>uint32_t"},{"parent":"77d0f921b17650c6","children":[],"id":"907bae19a1547628","title":"int32_t。如果发现在一台电脑上，不是32位，咋办？<br>&nbsp;int"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"77d0f921b17650c6","title":"关于类型别名，官方的命名"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"987e40331179f7e6","title":"类型别名"},{"parent":"297148c2b0206f54","children":[{"parent":"fca6519533b87f20","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"f0912a81c9f4bbc0","title":"注意：&nbsp;在C语言中，布尔值不是一个内置数据类型。<br>bool flag;"},{"parent":"fca6519533b87f20","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"1e23e288a0a613a6","title":"需要引入一个头文件 stdbool.h"},{"parent":"fca6519533b87f20","children":[{"parent":"ea6a58d1e9302255","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"64623dd901cd3e9b","title":"为了表示布尔值C语言规定：<br><br>任何非零值都被视为true(真)<br>任何零值都被视为false(假)<br>"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"ea6a58d1e9302255","title":"需要知道哪些值为真"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"fca6519533b87f20","title":"布尔值"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"297148c2b0206f54","title":"基本数据类型"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"6aba9437eea0ccb0","children":[{"parent":"f23819c8e8489714","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"d6b17bdb0deffc21","title":"主要作用：&nbsp;就是一个表达式的结果。&nbsp;我们关注主要主要作用，主要是因为。&nbsp;<br>在大表达式中，是小表达式的主要作用在起作用"},{"parent":"f23819c8e8489714","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"837eb15d2c9b7d3f","title":"副作用：&nbsp;除了主要作用以外的作用。&nbsp;比如，修改了变量的值。&nbsp;<br>比如，一些IO操作，这时候也是副作用。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"f23819c8e8489714","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"84fccd984a983a17","title":"理解主要作用，和副作用可以帮助我们理解更准确的大的表达式。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"f23819c8e8489714","title":"主要作用和副作用"},{"parent":"6aba9437eea0ccb0","children":[{"parent":"bbe0f614ab65e6c8","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"af62d981a1855959","title":"优先级就是一个运算符的优先顺序。结合性就是在优先级相同的时候，怎么结合"},{"parent":"bbe0f614ab65e6c8","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"b8359a25f5a95c1e","title":"a+b-c:&nbsp;这个+和-的优先级相同，这时候就看结合性"},{"parent":"bbe0f614ab65e6c8","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"4027f75afcb14516","title":"a*b-c+d/2:&nbsp;&nbsp;"},{"parent":"bbe0f614ab65e6c8","children":[{"parent":"618f1821ce73dc80","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"feb516ee8e8feb47","title":"(b-a&gt;&gt;1) + a"},{"parent":"618f1821ce73dc80","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"96f48343e7b4a6ab","title":"*p++"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"618f1821ce73dc80","title":"注意一些比较难的表达式"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"bbe0f614ab65e6c8","title":"优先级和结合性"},{"parent":"6aba9437eea0ccb0","children":[{"parent":"0918e49a9441fe72","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"16px"},"id":"b2482fec8941483b","title":"程序员不要自己为难自己"},{"parent":"0918e49a9441fe72","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"713bd378319c3e5d","title":"自己写代码的时候直接使用()。&nbsp;<br>不要使用这种很复杂的优先级和结合性。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"16px"},"id":"0918e49a9441fe72","title":"理解主要作用，副作用。<br>优先级和结合性对于我们读懂一个表达式，至关重要。<br>换句话说，如果不懂这些，有些表达式是看不懂的"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"6aba9437eea0ccb0","title":"优先级和结合性"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"149fd9a1beca4988","children":[{"parent":"74adb8a6855a3486","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"a60735ea0711f89d","title":"&lt;&lt; :&nbsp;左移。就是将表达的二进制数整体往左挪动n位。<br>a &lt;&lt; b：将a表示的二进制数，整体挪b位，低位填0"},{"parent":"74adb8a6855a3486","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"cd70a0d592944acf","title":"&gt;&gt;：&nbsp;右移。 C中无符号数直接逻辑右移。&nbsp;有符号数，取决于编译器实现"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"74adb8a6855a3486","title":"移位运算"},{"parent":"149fd9a1beca4988","children":[{"parent":"19521243aa40fb64","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"27b9dfaf8e23b32c","title":"按位取反~：&nbsp;将二进制数，每一位都取反"},{"parent":"19521243aa40fb64","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"665fb2a82b062d1b","title":"按位与&amp;"},{"parent":"19521243aa40fb64","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"94f79bce01bbd1a8","title":"按位异或^"},{"parent":"19521243aa40fb64","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"1ff8cb588ef3fe95","title":"按位或|"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"19521243aa40fb64","title":"按位运算符"},{"parent":"149fd9a1beca4988","children":[{"parent":"d369282c3106a330","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"fe157cb029588d07","title":"int find_last_set_bit(int n) {<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; return n &amp; (-n);<br>}<br>上述的代码是在求一个叫做LSB的玩意。我现在的问题是<br>1.首先，帮我解释一下什么是LSB。&nbsp;用小白的话说，不要搞非常专业的术语，目的就是越简单听懂越好<br>2.帮我解释一下这个代码是什么意思。最好举一个例子说明。一步一步分析，最后为什么得出了结论<br>"},{"parent":"d369282c3106a330","children":[{"parent":"a2bce4a44bda6ff1","children":[],"id":"b5ecd6b6d53f19db","title":"1.清晰的描述出你想要什么"},{"parent":"a2bce4a44bda6ff1","children":[],"id":"dff36c37cd89b41f","title":"2.不断的迭代。（不断的改进）"},{"parent":"a2bce4a44bda6ff1","children":[],"id":"f49116aa45288cc8","title":"3.可以告诉它具体的思路。"}],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"a2bce4a44bda6ff1","title":"怎么问GPT的话"},{"parent":"d369282c3106a330","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"e13dfcb8fe18286e","title":"a^a = 0"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"d369282c3106a330","title":"面试题"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"149fd9a1beca4988","title":"位运算符"}],"root":true,"theme":"{\"background\":\"#ffffff\",\"title\":\"基础曲线\",\"startType\":[],\"marginH\":24,\"marginW\":50,\"childMarginH\":24,\"childMarginW\":16,\"common\":{\"family\":\"微软雅黑\",\"italic\":false,\"textAlign\":\"left\"},\"connectionStyle\":{\"lineWidth\":2,\"lineColor\":\"#8A8A8A\",\"color\":\"#ffffff\"},\"centerTopic\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"#00A59A\",\"color\":\"#fff\",\"font-size\":\"20px\",\"border-radius\":\"12px\",\"padding\":\"13px 20px\",\"font-weight\":\"normal\",\"font-family\":\"微软雅黑\",\"font-style\":\"normal\"},\"secTopic\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"#EEEEEE\",\"border-radius\":\"10px\",\"color\":\"#0D0D0DE5\",\"font-size\":\"18px\",\"padding\":\"8px 14px\",\"lineStyle\":{\"lineType\":\"curve\",\"lineWidth\":2,\"lineColor\":\"#484848\"},\"font-family\":\"微软雅黑\",\"font-weight\":\"normal\",\"font-style\":\"normal\"},\"childTopic\":{\"font-size\":\"16px\",\"color\":\"#0D0D0DE5\",\"padding\":\"3px 12px\",\"font-weight\":\"normal\",\"lineStyle\":{\"lineType\":\"roundBroken\",\"lineWidth\":2,\"lineColor\":\"#484848\"},\"font-family\":\"微软雅黑\",\"font-style\":\"normal\",\"border-radius\":\"30px\"},\"id\":\"customise_efe174d4bfb5\"}","showWatermark":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"root","title":"Day02_basic2","version":784,"structure":"mind"}},"meta":{"exportTime":"2025-05-14 21:32:13","member":"","diagramInfo":{"creator":"","created":"","modified":"","title":"","category":""},"id":"","type":"ProcessOn Schema File","version":"1.0"}}